tayga (0.9.2-11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Users of the systemd unit tayga.service should note that the
    previously ignored options CONFIGURE_IFACE and CONFIGURE_NAT44 from
    /etc/default/tayga are now respected.

    This may cause issues if you have custom firewall rules or configured
    the tayga nat64 interface yourself. You may inhibit this behaviour by
    setting the options to "no".

 -- Daniel Gröber <dxld@darkboxed.org>  Sun, 16 Nov 2025 10:25:24 +0100
